     A*  MEDICARE 2ND PAY DATA ERROR CODE TABLE FILE
     A*
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PDE01                     TEXT('MEDICARE ERROR TABLE FILE')
     A            DECO#     R     S         REFFLD(CO#)
     A                                      COLHDG('CO#')
     A            DECODE         5A
     A                                      COLHDG('ERROR CODE')
     A            DEDESC    R               REFFLD(DS00)
     A                                      COLHDG('ERROR CODE' 'DESCRIPTION')
     A            DESTAT    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('STATUS')
     A*
     A* MAINTENANCE INFORMATION
     A*
     A            DEUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A            DEPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A            DETIME    R     S         REFFLD(TIME)
     A            DEDT      R     S         REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'MAINTAINED')
     A            DEIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'USER')
     A            DEIPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'PROGRAM')
     A            DEITIM    R     S         REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'TIME')
     A            DEIDT     R     S         REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'DATE')
     A*** BEG ADD *** 11/17/09 *********************************************
     A            DEFLD         50A         COLHDG('INCORRECT FIELD')
     A*** END ADD *** 11/17/09 *********************************************
